  "prefLabel": "Fis 1502.14 Validity of Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1502.14 Validity of Registration. No registration certificate issued by the department pursuant to this chapter shall be treated as valid until the document has been signed in ink by the registrant.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18",
